{
  "name": "Expert Divination",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Casting divination spells comes so easily to you that it expends only a fraction of your spellcasting efforts. When you cast a divination spell of 2nd level or higher using a spell slot, you regain spell slots with a combined level one lower than the spell cast. The slot you regain can't be higher than 5th level.</p>",
